@section 14. Bugs

@para
File issues at `https://github.com/paideia-os/cp/issues`. Include
the invocation, the `cp --version` output (build hash + signature
fingerprint), and the audit record id (rendered by cp `--verbose`
on stderr) so the audit log is queryable during triage.

